  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting job opportunities in the arts and the peace culture as a means of preventing youth violence in El Salvador.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Young people from the violent neighborhoods of Mejicanos, Ciudad Delgado, Cuscatancingo, Tecoluca, Zacatecoluca and Jiqulisco struggle to acquire job and life skills that would improve their livelihoods.Asociacin Intersectorial para el Desarrollo Econmico y Progreso Social(CIDEP) builds supportive local alliances and provides technical assistance to children and adolescents to develop skills in leadership, violence prevention, employability and culture of peace.At the IAF, we support community-led solutions to enhance peace and security in El Salvador.CIDEPs activities strengthen communities through education and training and build peer-to-peer learning and action networks.</narrative>
  </description>
